	(text
		"PCIe GPU test rig - power box wiring"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 22.86 0)
		(effects (font (size 3.0 3.0) bold) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "6b2f0c1e-2000-4000-8000-000000000052")
	)
	(text
		"Rev C  2026-09-28.  XT60 panel connectors replace the pigtail; meter ahead of the switch; WAGO ground bus. PZEM-031 terminals top->bottom 1..4."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 27.94 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "6b2f0c1e-2000-4000-8000-000000000053")
	)
	(text
		"Path: 12V IN -> F1 -> M1 (3 in, 4 out) -> SW1 -> outputs.  The meter reads whenever the supply is on; the switch only gates the outputs."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 124.46 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "6b2f0c1e-2000-4000-8000-000000000054")
	)
	(text
		"M1 PZEM-031: shunt is internal between 2 (DC IN-) and 1 (LOAD-). Input negative goes to 2, NOT to the bus - on the bus it would bypass the shunt and the meter would read 0 A."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 129.54 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "6b2f0c1e-2000-4000-8000-000000000055")
	)
	(text
		"W1 WAGO 221-415, five ports: 5 = LOAD-, 4 = RISER -, 3 = CARD -, 2 = OUT - post, 1 = PROBE GND. The rocker's yellow LED - rides on the OUT - post's terminal."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 134.62 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "6b2f0c1e-2000-4000-8000-000000000056")
	)
	(text
		"SW1: A (power) from M1.4, B (load) to the outputs, yellow to ground. NEVER swap B and yellow - that is a dead short the moment it is switched on. Beep the pins first."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 139.7 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "6b2f0c1e-2000-4000-8000-000000000057")
	)
	(text
		"Ratings: OWON at 12.0 V, OVP ~12.6 V, current limit 5 A (CC for short hunting). F1 5 A blade (7.5 max). Switch 20 A, XT60 30 A, 14 AWG silicone inside. J4 is optional - fit one or two outputs."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 144.78 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "6b2f0c1e-2000-4000-8000-000000000058")
	)
	(text
		"Panels:  REAR = J1, J2a, J2b.   TOP deck = M1, SW1, J6 (+ riser dock).   RIGHT wall = J3, J4, J5a, J5b.   F1 and W1 are inline inside."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 152.4 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "6b2f0c1e-2000-4000-8000-000000000059")
	)
